# Data and State

- Server data uses React Query hooks in `src/lib/query`
- Client UI state uses Zustand in `src/lib/store`
- No `fetch`/`axios` directly inside components
- API calls live in `src/lib/services`
- Transform API data in `src/lib/adapter` before UI use
- Keep shared types in `src/lib/types`
- Features orchestrate data and consume components
- Strip or redact PII before sending prompts to AI services
- Never expose model keys or secrets to the client

## Feature File Conventions
- `*.api.ts` → API calls
- `*.queries.ts` → TanStack Query hooks
- `*.store.ts` → Zustand (feature-scoped)
